  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging Communities through Participatory Agreements: The implementation of a mobile intervention unit to facilitate human-jaguar coexistence around the Calakmul Biosphere Reserve (Mexico)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the conservation of jaguars in the Calakmul Biosphere Reserve and adjacent areas in the Southern Yucatan Peninsula of Mexico by reducing retaliatory killings because of depredation on cattle.</narrative>
  </description>
